           _p_i_d___t _c_s___p_i_d       Always set to 0.

     The _i_p_i_n_f_o___t argument contains IP fields common to both IPv4 and IPv6
     packets.  Its fields are:

           _u_i_n_t_8___t _i_p___v_e_r       IP version of the packet, 4 for IPv4 packets
                                and 6 for IPv6 packets.

